# Source is LF everywhere, on every platform.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true writes CRLF into a Windows working tree
# while the agents and editors that touch these files write LF. gofmt reads
# CRLF as unformatted, so `gofmt -l` lights up the entire tree and stops
# being a signal — which is how a genuinely misformatted file goes unnoticed
# inside sixty false ones.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go     text eol=lf diff=golang
*.ts     text eol=lf
*.css    text eol=lf
*.sql    text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.html   text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
